{"version":1,"content":"<p>SpaceX正與美國主要通信基站運營商展開談判，計劃獲得全美至少8萬個地面基站的使用權，以建立覆蓋全國的移動通信網絡，直接挑戰AT&amp;T、Verizon和T-Mobile三大傳統運營商。根據10月22日披露的消息，SpaceX正在與Crown Castle等通信基礎設施企業商討基站租賃協議，潛在交易金額可能達到數十億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583458.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.829032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:28:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"47916e2255f8b263aed8f233416a133085af5330a984f6413210c05bd75c2966","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}